# A call by name on the prototype object of a constructor function, under a name that Object.prototype has too: until the function is linked below the class the call enters the engine's own function. So the result of the member of the class is not all that the call gives. The member is entered all the same.
# f1 = Sub, f2 = value, f4 = valueOf
